&lt;li&gt;Experience working directly with director and C-level clients on strategy development&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent project management skills, able to find the most efficient ways of working&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent written and verbal communication skills&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advanced problem-solving skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A high attention to detail and excellent organisational skills / time management skills&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to react quickly within a fast-paced environment&lt;/li&gt;
