&lt;p&gt;We are looking for an&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Engineering Manager&lt;/strong&gt; to join Doctolib&#39;s &lt;strong&gt;Automation Platform&lt;/strong&gt; (AUTOP) team, which empowers all Doctolib engineers to build, test, and deploy software with confidence and speed.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As part of the Platform organization, Autop’s mission is to &lt;strong&gt;build and maintain the automation infrastructure and developer tools&lt;/strong&gt; that enable our engineering teams to deliver high-quality software efficiently. Every feature shipped at Doctolib — from appointment booking to teleconsultation to AI-powered clinical tools — flows through AUTOP&#39;s automation infrastructure. We&#39;re the platform behind the platform. When product teams ship faster, safer, and with more confidence, it&#39;s because AUTOP built the rails they run on.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;AUTOP (Automation Platform) is responsible for critical developer-facing systems including: CI/CD automation, testing infrastructure (unit, integration, E2E, contract, visual regression), local and ephemeral development environments, release management, dependency management, and developer productivity tooling.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you will do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As the Engineering Manager for AUTOP, your responsibilities include, but are not limited to:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;People leadership&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and lead a high-performing team of 6 engineers who are passionate about developer productivity;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create a culture where engineers own outcomes, not tasks — where platform adoption and developer satisfaction are the north stars;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Recruit, mentor, and retain top platform engineering talent in a competitive market;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct impactful 1:1s, performance reviews, and career development conversations that help engineers reach their full potential.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Technical Strategy &amp;amp; Execution&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define and drive the technical vision for your team&#39;s domain (CI/CD, testing infrastructure, developer environments, or release automation);&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Make high-impact technical decisions that balance short-term delivery with long-term sustainability and scale;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set the bar for automation, quality, reliability, and security — your systems must be highly reliable because 800 engineers+ depending on them daily;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Champion a &quot;Platform as a Product&quot; mindset: treat internal developers as customers, measure adoption and satisfaction, iterate based on feedback;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner strategically with product teams, Infrastructure Platform, and Applicative Platform to solve cross-cutting challenges;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive measurable improvements in developer productivity metrics: build times, deployment frequency, test reliability, time-to-production… supporting Doctolib teams to monitor their metrics (DORA, performance, costs, etc).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Impact &amp;amp; Influence&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be a visible technical leader across the organization — your team&#39;s work enables everyone else&#39;s success;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Influence engineering culture: establish best practices, contribute to technical strategy beyond your team;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Navigate ambiguity and lead through influence, not authority — platform adoption requires trust and advocacy, not mandates.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About our tech environment&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Our automation platform supports a hybrid architecture: a large Ruby on Rails monolith and an expanding ecosystem of modern microservices (Java, Kotlin, TypeScript)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We maintain sophisticated CI/CD pipelines using GitHub Actions, testing frameworks across multiple languages, and infrastructure-as-code solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Our systems handle thousands of CI builds daily, manage comprehensive test suites across multiple languages, and manage deployments across multiple environments for 200+ development teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Our stack includes: Ruby, Java, Kotlin, Go, TypeScript, Docker, Kubernetes, GitHub Actions, Terraform, and various testing frameworks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We intentionally&amp;nbsp;leverage AI to improve developer productivity and reliability, in a sustainable manner .&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who you are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Before you read on — if you don&#39;t have the exact profile described below, but you feel this job description matches your skill set, we still encourage you to apply.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;6+ years of software engineering and 3+ years managing technical teams — you have a proven experience and know what great engineering looks like&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep platform engineering expertise: CI/CD, developer tooling, automation, testing infrastructure, or internal platforms&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track record of building &quot;Platform as a Product&quot; — you&#39;ve driven adoption, measured impact, and iterated based on developer feedback&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong stakeholder management — you can influence without authority, build coalitions, and navigate complex organizational dynamics&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to balance technical depth with people leadership — you can code-review a Terraform module and coach a report through a difficult conversation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluent in English and comfortable influencing across a multi-country organization&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Now it would be fantastic if you:&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Are passionate about developer experience and understand what makes engineers productive and happy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have an entrepreneurial mindset — comfortable with ambiguity, fast iteration, and building the plane while flying it&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have experience managing distributed or remote teams across time zones&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have background in healthcare, regulated industries, or mission-critical systems where reliability and security are non-negotiable&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 data-start=&quot;87&quot; data-end=&quot;122&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A Deutschlandticket (Germany-wide public transport pass) fully paid for by Doctolib&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;28 vacation days + 1 additional day for each full calendar year of employment (up to a maximum of 30 days)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work from abroad for up to 10 days per year thanks to our flexibility days policy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Company health insurance with great supplementary benefits through our partner Allianz&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Company pension scheme (bAV) through Allianz with an employer subsidy&lt;br&gt;of 40% (15% within the probationary period)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enrollment in Doctolib&#39;s long-term employee value sharing plan called DoctoGrowth&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The Doctolib Parent Care program, which includes one month additional parental leave and much more&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Free mental health and coaching services through our partner Moka.care&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Subsidized sports membership through our partner Urban Sports Club&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A flexible workplace policy offering both hybrid and office-based mode&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Alongside healthy snacks and our regular breakfast buffet, we provide a subsidized meal benefit&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;For caregivers and workers with disabilities, a package including an adaptation of the remote policy, extra days off for medical reasons, and psychological support&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The interview process&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Recruiter Interview&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;System Design Interview&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Behavioral Interview&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Engineering Manager Case Study&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;At least one reference check&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job Details&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Permanent position&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Full Time&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Based in Berlin&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hybrid position 3 days/week in the office&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Start date: As soon as possible&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you would like to find out more about tech life at Doctolib, feel free to read our latest&lt;a href=&quot;https://medium.com/doctolib&quot;&gt; Medium blog articles&lt;/a&gt;!&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;At Doctolib, we are committed to improving access to healthcare for everyone. This translates into our recruitment process. We evaluate candidates based solely on qualifications and motivation, without any form of discrimination.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;The more diverse ideas are heard, the more our product will truly improve healthcare for all. You are welcome to apply to Doctolib, regardless of your gender, religion, age, sexual orientation, ethnicity, disability.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;To ensure equal opportunities, we invite you to exclude personal information (e.g. pictures, age) from your applications. If you require any accommodation, please let us know for support during the hiring process.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Join us in building the healthcare we all dream of!&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;87&quot; data-end=&quot;122&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;All information provided is processed by Doctolib for application management. For data processing details, click&lt;/em&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://media.doctolib.com/image/upload/v1678356494/legal/Career-Privacy-Policy-Feb-23-EN.pdf&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt; &lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;here&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em&gt;. Please contact hr.dataprivacy(at)doctolib.com for inquiries or to exercise your rights.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com">Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;h2&gt;Enterprise Account Executive&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sumo Logic helps make the digital world faster, reliable and more secure&lt;/strong&gt;.&amp;nbsp; Our purpose is to bring teams together to solve observability and security issues for digital enterprises.&amp;nbsp; Sumo is a SaaS Analytics pioneer in continuous intelligence, a new category of software, which enables organisations of all sizes to address the data challenges and opportunities presented by digital transformation, modern applications, and cloud computing. The Sumo Logic Continuous Intelligence Platform™ automates the collection, ingestion, and analysis of application, infrastructure, security, and IoT data to derive actionable insights within seconds. More than 2,400 customers rely on Sumo Logic to build, run, and secure their modern applications and cloud infrastructures. Only Sumo Logic delivers its platform as a true, multi-tenant SaaS architecture, across multiple use-cases, enabling businesses to thrive in the Intelligence Economy.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are seeking an experienced and highly motivated tech savvy,&amp;nbsp; sales professional to help us fuel our growth and develop our relationships with both new and existing customers.&amp;nbsp; We seek an experienced salesperson able to effectively balance high velocity deals with larger complex deals, working in partnership with our channel partners. Our ideal candidate will be a hunter, who has consistently been in the top 10% of the sales teams she/he has worked within. They will have a track record of growing sales, a creative and consultative approach, be able to take initiative to produce results combined with polished presentation skills.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Target, manage and sell to new and existing customers, exceed revenue quota goals.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrate the ability to address each customer and partner&#39;s unique needs, while providing them with the relevant information and appropriate solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working alongside your dedicated Pre-Sales Engineer deliver compelling demo’s, discovery and technical solutions that meet the customers business and technical needs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Align with your dedicated SDR to create compelling outreach campaigns and generate sales pipeline.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Qualify and manage inbound leads in order to process through the sales funnel.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Close and process all prospects, managing an end-to-end sales lifecycle working alongside our talented Pre-Sales Engineers, Professional Services, Sales operations, deal desk, legal and marketing teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Engage with Channel Partners and Alliances to extend market reach.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with our Customer Success Team for client reviews.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create and deliver accurate sales forecasts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide timely and insightful input back to other corporate functions, particularly product management and marketing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluent German and English speaker&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Desired Qualifications, Skills and Experience:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Effective Selling:&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrable sales experience selling B2B software applications; on-demand/SaaS, Security Solutions &amp;amp; IT Infrastructure Management solutions.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record of selling to both a technical audience like IT Operations, Security, and Dev/Ops leaders and practitioners, as well as engaging with Economic Buyers C-level and Procurement teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deliver oral and written communications that are impactful and persuasive with their intended audience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build compelling presentations in conjunction with SE’s for PoV’s, Pro Services and commercial business cases&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Customer &amp;amp; Territory Management:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act in ways that demonstrate customer focus and satisfaction by building effective relationships with customers and prospects.&amp;nbsp; Identifying, meeting and exceeding customer expectations, by treating customers with dignity and respect.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage territory, considering each and all accounts, collectively.&amp;nbsp; Establish accurate plans and forecast, prioritise efforts, generate short term results whilst holding a long term perspective to maximise overall territory viability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;In-depth knowledge of given industry and relevant marketplace; can speak with authority, e.g., on industry trends, best practices, competitive practices, regulatory issues, etc.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cultural Fit&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Thrive in a fast-paced, high-growth and rapidly changing industry.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Passionate about technology to resolve customer problems and operates as a team player, who communicates effectively, and works well in a winning but positive team environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experienced in company applications such as CRM SFDC and is consistent and timely delivering key tasks such as forecasts, completing enablement training and attending essential company meetings, town halls.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Good understanding of sales methodologies such as Meddpicc, sales challengers or other sales methods.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we can offer you&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent remuneration package with quarterly wellness days and other benefits&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Opportunity to earn with an excellent commission complan, built in accelerators, exciting quarterly SPIFFs, President Club, and other awards&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Full Onboarding and enablement to develop your skills and continuous learning&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Creative and innovative Leadership team who are engaged with our field sales teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A growing client base, -&amp;nbsp; we are challenging the traditional &amp;amp; legacy ISV’s in this space&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A dynamic but empathetic, and caring culture - all SUMO’s are respected across the world and celebrate diversity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We have won over 60+ awards as one of the best places to work!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An award winning and truly powerful SaaS Analytics platform, in Gartner MQ for both Security &amp;amp; Observability&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Us&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Sumo Logic, Inc. helps make the digital world secure, fast, and reliable by unifying critical security and operational data through its Intelligent Operations Platform. Built to address the increasing complexity of modern cybersecurity and cloud operations challenges, we empower digital teams to move from reaction to readiness—combining agentic AI-powered SIEM and log analytics into a single platform to detect, investigate, and resolve modern challenges. Customers around the world rely on Sumo Logic for trusted insights to protect against security threats, ensure reliability, and gain powerful insights into their digital environments. For more information, visit&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.sumologic.com/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-saferedirecturl=&quot;https://www.google.com/url?q=http://www.sumologic.com/&amp;amp;source=gmail&amp;amp;ust=1763582776811000&amp;amp;usg=AOvVaw2tkPOBgFpGkG4SEdY6I_TY&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;www.sumologic.com.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.sumologic.com/privacy-statement/&quot;&gt;Sumo Logic Privacy Policy&lt;/a&gt;. Employees will be responsible for complying with applicable federal privacy laws and regulations, as well as organizational policies related to data protection.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Compensation varies based on a variety of factors which include (but aren’t limited to) role level, skills and competencies, qualifications, knowledge, location, and experience. In addition to base pay, certain roles are eligible to participate in our bonus or commission plans, as well as our benefits offerings, and equity awards. #LI-REMOTE&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com">Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Banyan Software is the best permanent home for software businesses that serve specialized industries, their employees, and their customers. We are on a mission to acquire, build, and grow great companies worldwide, helping them modernize through shared AI expertise and operational discipline. The Banyan Software Foundation, endowed with $100 million in Banyan stock, leverages technology to build a greener and more equitable world. Banyan is Great Place to Work Certified, a five-time Inc. 5000 honoree, and a top 10 company on the Deloitte Technology Fast 500. Founded in 2016 and headquartered in Atlanta, Banyan operates more than 100 portfolio companies across North America, the UK, EU, and APAC.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div id=&quot;fortidlp-input-element-parent&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Banyan Software&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Banyan Software is the best permanent home for software businesses that serve specialized industries, their employees, and their customers. We are on a mission to acquire, build, and grow great companies worldwide, helping them modernize through shared AI expertise and operational discipline. The Banyan Software Foundation, endowed with $100 million in Banyan stock, leverages technology to build a greener and more equitable world. Banyan is Great Place to Work Certified, a five-time Inc. 5000 honoree, and a top 10 company on the Deloitte Technology Fast 500. Founded in 2016 and headquartered in Atlanta, Banyan operates more than 100 portfolio companies across North America, the UK, EU, and APAC.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About HMM Deutschland GmbH&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;HMM Deutschland GmbH is a specialist healthcare workflow processor headquartered in NRW, Germany, serving major German statutory health insurers (GKV). The company manages high-volume claims processing and pharmaceutical billing workflows for leading GKV customers — providing mission-critical infrastructure for the German statutory health system with deeply embedded, long-term customer relationships.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Having recently joined the Banyan Software family, the business is entering an exciting new chapter — applying AI-driven process automation to strengthen operational excellence while deepening long-standing customer partnerships.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are hiring a Director of Customer Operations &amp;amp; Projects (m/w/d) to own the entire customer delivery layer of the business. This is a senior leadership role at the heart of operations: you will run the project management function, govern BPO and SLA operations across all service lines, and serve as the senior relationship owner for the company&#39;s most strategically important accounts.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role is central to the company&#39;s value creation plan under Banyan. You will lead the business through a consequential AI-driven operational transformation while protecting the customer trust and SLA performance that define its market position. You will report directly to the CEO, partner closely with the CPTO on technology delivery, and work with Banyan&#39;s DACH Operating Partner on strategic priorities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Will Own&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Leadership &amp;amp; Team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Reset and professionalise the delivery function — establish clear standards, accountabilities, and operating rhythms across the customer operations and project management teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Organise the team around key customer programmes and strategic projects; ensure every initiative has clear ownership, milestones, and governance from day one&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build a high-performing, cohesive team: hire well, develop talent, set expectations clearly, and address underperformance directly and without delay&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create a culture of delivery discipline — where commitments are made carefully, tracked rigorously, and met consistently&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coach and develop the next layer of leadership within the PM and customer operations team, building capacity that does not depend on the Director as a bottleneck&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the team through significant operational change — AI-driven transformation, process redesign, and capability building — with clarity, transparency, and pace&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Project Management Function&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the project management methodology end-to-end: governance gates, risk and issue tracking, change control, templates, and lessons learned&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead and develop the PM team; set quality standards and drive consistent delivery discipline across all active customer projects&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain a live portfolio view of all active projects — status, budget, risk, and milestones — reported to the CEO and Banyan monthly&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as the final internal escalation point for any project rated red or amber; bring structure and momentum where delivery is at risk&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with the CPTO to integrate AI and technology delivery projects into the customer governance framework&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive adoption and hygiene of the existing toolstack across the team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Account — Senior Relationship Ownership&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as the senior relationship owner for the company&#39;s largest and highest-priority customer accounts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own account project plans: milestones, deliverables, resource allocation, change management, and acceptance criteria&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Chair programme steering committees; maintain live risk registers; escalate blockers to the CEO within 24 hours&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure contractual SLAs are met every month; manage any miss proactively, not reactively&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify expansion opportunities within key accounts: additional workflow coverage, module adoption, and AI-assisted process enhancements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Protect relationship continuity through the company&#39;s AI-driven transformation — no surprises, no disruption to service&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;BPO Operations &amp;amp; SLA Governance&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own delivery SLAs across all workflow service lines; track KPIs including tickets per FTE, cost per case, time-to-resolution, first-time-right rate, and touchless processing rate&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage the operations team through an AI-driven headcount restructuring while maintaining throughput and quality throughout the transition&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Project-manage a major in-house billing capability transition, ensuring customer SLAs are uninterrupted throughout&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Produce a monthly SLA performance dashboard — RAG-rated, trend-based, corrective actions flagged — for the CEO and Banyan Operating Partner&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead quarterly service reviews with all major customers: own the agenda, the data, and the follow-up actions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Customer Satisfaction &amp;amp; Retention&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the customer satisfaction framework: NPS or equivalent, structured feedback loops, and a closed-loop process for acting on customer input&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Personally manage the company&#39;s most important customer relationships with regular check-ins, escalation ownership, and relationship health tracking&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor churn risk signals: SLA trends, open tickets, stakeholder changes, and contract renewal timelines&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Represent the customer voice internally — in roadmap discussions, resource prioritisation, and transformation sequencing decisions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications for Success&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Direct experience in healthcare IT, GKV/SGB workflow processing, pharmaceutical billing, or a similarly regulated German-speaking healthcare services environment&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record owning large, complex customer-facing programmes — multi-year, multi-stakeholder, with hard SLA accountability; experience running or building a PMO or PM team is a strong advantage&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Background managing or transforming high-volume BPO or managed services operations — comfortable with throughput economics: tickets/FTE, cost-per-case, and SLA governance at scale&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track record owning senior customer relationships at Director or Head of Operations level, including escalation management and account recovery&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to build, lead, and develop high-performing operational teams through periods of significant change&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Business fluent in both German and English — required for customer communication, team leadership, and Banyan internal reporting&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience leading teams through AI-driven or technology-led operational transformation without eroding customer trust or SLA performance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Germany-based with willingness to work regularly from our NRW office and travel to customer sites; NRW region strongly preferred&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We Offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Base salary: €120,000 – €150,000 per annum, depending on experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Annual performance bonus: up to 20–25% of base salary, tied to account delivery, BPO SLA attainment, and AI-driven process improvement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;30 days annual leave&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Company pension (bAV) with employer contribution&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible hybrid working — NRW office and customer site presence required&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Relocation support available for candidates outside the NRW/DACH region&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
