&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;4xs9yz&quot; data-start=&quot;992&quot; data-end=&quot;1079&quot;&gt;Strong interpersonal and communication skills, combined with a collaborative mindset.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;15tjol6&quot; data-start=&quot;1080&quot; data-end=&quot;1146&quot;&gt;A structured, reliable, and goal-oriented approach to your work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1ei1zav&quot; data-start=&quot;1147&quot; data-end=&quot;1251&quot;&gt;A high level of initiative and the ability to work independently while taking ownership of your tasks.&lt;/li&gt;
